WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Governance reaches the body. Examine how institutional conditions shape lived experience.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Rules can shape control and dignity.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sensory load changes participation.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Chronic uncertainty taxes attention.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Measure conditions without overclaiming.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Design institutions people can inhabit.
